# _headers — Cloudflare Pages (FIX C2 da auditoria 2026-08-26).
#
# ATENÇÃO: o CF Pages só lê o _headers que está DENTRO do output do build
# (`.vercel/output/static`) — e `next-app/public/` entra no output. O
# `_headers` da raiz do repo NUNCA foi deployado com o app Next (a CSP
# documentada em DEPLOYMENT.md não estava no ar). Este arquivo é o portado.
#
# Limitação do Pages: estas regras valem pra ASSETS ESTÁTICOS (HTML
# prerenderizado incluso), não pra respostas de Functions — por isso a CSP e
# os headers de segurança TAMBÉM estão no headers() do next.config.mjs, que
# cobre as rotas servidas pelo worker (/api/* etc.). Mudou aqui? Mude lá.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.sentry-cdn.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; media-src 'self' blob: data: https://*.supabase.co; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co wss://*.supabase.co https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.ingest.sentry.io https://*.ingest.us.sentry.io https://sentry.io https://*.sentry.io https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://storage.googleapis.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(self), camera=(self), geolocation=(self), payment=(self), accelerometer=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

# Service worker — precisa controlar o escopo raiz e nunca ficar preso em cache
/sw.js
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# Digital Asset Links — verificação de domínio pra TWA Android (Play Store)
/.well-known/assetlinks.json
  Content-Type: application/json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

# Manifest do PWA — TWA precisa pra reconhecer o app
/manifest.webmanifest
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

# Portal (admin da loja) — fora de indexação e sempre fresco
/portal/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
